      "source": "For example, the function below uses a date format style to create a custom lexical representation of a date, then retrieves an attributed string representation of the same date and applies a visual emphasis to the year component of the date.",
      "normalizedSource": "For example, the function below uses a date format style to create a custom lexical representation of a date, then retrieves an attributed string representation of the same date and applies a visual emphasis to the year component of the date.",
